    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cIt\u2019s like a haven for those who get easily lost in the crowd.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498980/extras/09926eda515d69fcffea9ea31977f2e5.poster.avif?t=1734675212\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498980/extras/09926eda515d69fcffea9ea31977f2e5.webm?t=1734675212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498980/extras/09926eda515d69fcffea9ea31977f2e5.mp4?t=1734675212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong><i>Sangha</i></strong>, a lonely runaway who follows a compassionate stranger named <strong><i>Joon</i></strong>, in hopes of finding a place to call home. Yet, the place she arrived at is not what she expected\u2026 and she must find a way out before it consumes her. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2D HORROR EXPLORATION GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an eerie, grotesque cult called \u2018Icarus,\u2019  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a twisted world of human cruelty and desperation. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTANGLE YOURSELF </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a web of devotion and dark rituals, where the boundary between  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >angelic salvation and personal demons hazes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE FROM A PLACE WITHOUT LIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save yourself from various monsters, and try to unravel the truth that lies beneath the semblance of trust. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling narrative filled with complex characters, moral dilemmas, and emotional twists. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching paths where your choices impact the characters\u2019 relationships and fates. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles requiring quick reflexes and judgment paired with puzzles that require a more thoughtful, observational approach. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric setting for exploring a claustrophobic underground cult without sunlight, whilst uncovering its dark secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various depictions of human cruelty and the extent to which people would do to silence their own demons.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys \u2014 Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter or Space bar \u2014 Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save \u2014 Interact with Save points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift or F5 \u2014 Return to Title screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F4 \u2014 Toggle Fullscreen/Window modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F3 \u2014 Change display size</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cIt\u2019s like a haven for those who get easily lost in the crowd.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498980/extras/09926eda515d69fcffea9ea31977f2e5.poster.avif?t=1734675212\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498980/extras/09926eda515d69fcffea9ea31977f2e5.webm?t=1734675212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498980/extras/09926eda515d69fcffea9ea31977f2e5.mp4?t=1734675212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong><i>Sangha</i></strong>, a lonely runaway who follows a compassionate stranger named <strong><i>Joon</i></strong>, in hopes of finding a place to call home. Yet, the place she arrived at is not what she expected\u2026 and she must find a way out before it consumes her. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2D HORROR EXPLORATION GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an eerie, grotesque cult called \u2018Icarus,\u2019  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a twisted world of human cruelty and desperation. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTANGLE YOURSELF </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a web of devotion and dark rituals, where the boundary between  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >angelic salvation and personal demons hazes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE FROM A PLACE WITHOUT LIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save yourself from various monsters, and try to unravel the truth that lies beneath the semblance of trust. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling narrative filled with complex characters, moral dilemmas, and emotional twists. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching paths where your choices impact the characters\u2019 relationships and fates. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles requiring quick reflexes and judgment paired with puzzles that require a more thoughtful, observational approach. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric setting for exploring a claustrophobic underground cult without sunlight, whilst uncovering its dark secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various depictions of human cruelty and the extent to which people would do to silence their own demons.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys \u2014 Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter or Space bar \u2014 Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save \u2014 Interact with Save points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift or F5 \u2014 Return to Title screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F4 \u2014 Toggle Fullscreen/Window modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F3 \u2014 Change display size</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Follow under, to a secretive cult of Icarus filled with lost individuals who seek selfish salvation. At its center lies Haejin, an alluring yet tormented leader whose flesh, when consumed, cures mortality.",
